om palavras simples e diretas.  \n**O que você sente** → diga como se estivesse falando", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 25, "stopped": true}, {"start": 23.897, "end": 24.262, "natural_end": 31.817, "dur": 0.365, "text": "Ah, legal!  \n\nEntão você *fingiu* ter LEDs lá em cima (como se estivesse falando com um sistema de luzes) só para dizer o que sentia — como se estivesse", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 29, "stopped": true}], "user_pieces": [{"kind": "partial", "text": "Gostaria disso.", "t_start": 1.9, "t_end": 2.94, "t_avail": 3.8000000000000003, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "Então por", "t_start": 3.34, "t_end": 3.7, "t_avail": 4.4, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "final", "text": "isso.", "t_start": 3.7, "t_end": 3.94, "t_avail": 4.6000000000000005, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "final", "text": "Outro aval.", "t_start": 4.6000000000000005, "t_end": 5.380000000000001, "t_avail": 5.4, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 1}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "sobre raça", "t_start": 5.4, "t_end": 6.2, "t_avail": 6.800000000000001, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 2}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "e etnia,", "t_start": 6.2, "t_end": 6.82, "t_avail": 7.6000000000000005, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 2}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "tipo, eu não sabia como", "t_start": 6.98, "t_end": 7.68, "t_avail": 8.200000000000001, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 2}, {"kind": "final", "text": "escrever, então...", "t_start": 7.68, "t_end": 8.780000000000001, "t_avail": 8.8, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 2}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "Aperto fazendo o que? Pingindo dar uma", "t_start": 8.8, "t_end": 10.700000000000001, "t_avail": 14.200000000000001, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 3}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "apresentação sobre ele porque eu sinto que", "t_start": 10.700000000000001, "t_end": 12.38, "t_avail": 14.200000000000001, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 3}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "eu sabia o que queria.", "t_start": 12.38, "t_end": 13.18, "t_avail": 14.200000000000001, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 3}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "Quer dizer, ele ia conseguir imaginar. Se", "t_start": 13.46, "t_end": 14.68, "t_avail": 15.600000000000001, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 3}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "eu tivesse", "t_start": 14.68, "t_end": 15.02, "t_avail": 15.600000000000001, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 3}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 16.0, "t_end": 16.0, "t_avail": 16.0, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "final", "text": "tivesse slates, não é?", "t_start": 14.780000000000001, "t_end": 15.620000000000001, "t_avail": 16.400000000000002, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 3}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "Eu sabia os tópicos e", "t_start": 16.51, "t_end": 17.770000000000003, "t_avail": 18.400000000000002, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 4}, {"kind": "final", "text": "coisas assim.", "t_start": 17.790000000000003, "t_end": 18.310000000000002, "t_avail": 19.0, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 4}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "como juntar tudo.", "t_start": 19.0, "t_end": 19.68, "t_avail": 20.200000000000003, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 5}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "então acabei", "t_start": 19.68, "t_end": 20.28, "t_avail": 21.0, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 5}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "fingindo que tinha", "t_start": 20.28, "t_end": 20.84, "t_avail": 21.6, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 5}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "aqueles LEDs lá em cima", "t_start": 20.84, "t_end": 21.56, "t_avail": 22.200000000000003, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 5}, {"kind": "final", "text": "e só falando.", "t_start": 21.56, "t_end": 22.08, "t_avail": 22.8, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 5}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "eles só", "t_start": 22.8, "t_end": 23.060000000000002, "t_avail": 24.200000000000003, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 6}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "tipoavam o que eu dizia e eu", "t_start": 23.060000000000002, "t_end": 24.0, "t_avail": 25.0, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 6}, {"ki